    {
      "bbox": [
        190,
        886,
        1497,
        1152
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the City of New York Administration for Children's Services (\"ACS\") provides early care and education services to children and families within New York City through its EarlyLearn NYC program, a subsidized system of care for children and families that combines Head Start, Child Care and Universal Pre-K services to create high quality early care and education programs for eligible infants, toddlers and preschoolers in New York City, through contracts with community-based providers for the provision of such services (\"Contracted Services\");",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.2639,
          "min": -1.239
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 100,
          "mean": -0.0006,
          "min": -0.0252
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 53771,
        "area_px": 340790,
        "density": 0.15778,
        "chars": 553,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 10.28
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        192,
        1195,
        1499,
        1384
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, on April 24, 2017, the launch of the 3K for All initiative was announced and, as part of this initiative, responsibility for the administration of the Contracted Services was to be transferred from ACS to the New York City Department of Education (\"DOE\") to create a more unified system of services for children from birth to age five (the \"EarlyLearn Transfer\");",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2406,
          "min": -1.3157
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 86,
          "mean": -0.0003,
          "min": -0.0206
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 35378,
        "area_px": 243432,
        "density": 0.14533,
        "chars": 372,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 10.52
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        194,
        1427,
        1461,
        1576
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, to facilitate the EarlyLearn Transfer, ACS and DOE entered into a contract, dated May 1, 2019, through which ACS will purchase such child services and related functions from DOE and assign to DOE its currently contracted child care and related agreements;",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2329,
          "min": -1.2311
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 55,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.004
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 26273,
        "area_px": 186399,
        "density": 0.14095,
        "chars": 264,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 10.05
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        226,
        1620,
        1492,
        1735
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the transfer of the responsibility of operating the EarlyLearn Contracted Services and all related responsibilities from ACS to DOE will require a functional transfer of certain ACS employees pursuant to Civil Service Law §70(2); and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2359,
          "min": -1.2572
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
